<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Scitec posts half profit turnaround.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Scitec posts half profit turnaround.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating		     profit 0.30 vs loss 2.49</p>
<p>    Net			     profit 0.30 vs loss 2.49</p>
<p>    Sales				   19.19 vs 17.47</p>
<p>    Other income			   0.72 vs 0.83</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		     gain 0.30 vs loss 3.0</p>
<p>    Tax					 nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.09 vs 0.16</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   0.87 vs 1.06</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Scitec Ltd is a manufacturer of telecommunications equipment.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
